3. Integrating, distributing, or embedding the software or its machine-learning
   models into any commercial product, hardware appliance, or enterprise software.
4. Using the software in any live commercial factory, industrial plant, warehouse,
   or commercial shipping terminal.

For commercial inquiries, licensing exemptions, or industrial deployment rights,
contact the repository owner.

